10 REM PROG.REM: everything after REM is commentary and does not run.
20 PRINT "one"
30 REM PRINT "never"
40 REM A colon does not end a comment: what follows it is still comment.
50 REM note : PRINT "also never"
60 REM PROG.COMMENT-MARK: an apostrophe may be written in place of REM,
70 REM and carries the same rules, the colon one included.
80 'PRINT "never either"
90 'tail : PRINT "nor this"
100 PRINT "two"
110 END
